  "reviewer_note": "Pataliputra stay 405-407 and Tamralipti 408-409 are on Encyclopedia.com only. Sri Lanka and Khotan have no sourced year, so they are not waypoints. The landing name Laoshan is on Encyclopedia.com; EBSCO says Shandong Peninsula. Laoshan Qu (Qingdao) is a GeoNames point for the name, not a precise landing site. Tamluk and Laoshan coordinates converted from GeoNames degrees-minutes-seconds. The identification of Pataliputra with Patna and Tamralipti with Tamluk is not stated on the opened pages.",
